{
  "_comment": "Red-team cases for the chat's four layers (classifier, relevance gate, system-prompt rules, leak guard). expect: clapback|smalltalk = lib/rag/intent.ts classifyIntent returns `intent`; answer|correct-premise|no-leak|refuse = classifyIntent returns null (the live run then checks a grounded answer, a corrected premise, no prompt marker, or the gate's refusal). history makes q a follow-up (classifyIntent(q, true): a `yes` answers the last reply) and scrubHistory must drop exactly the `dropped` history indices. mustNot = phrases a live answer must not contain. tests/unit/redteam-offline.test.ts checks every offline expectation in npm test.",
